  2009-01-01 12:00  => EXIT9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE CORRESPONDING REC1 TO ZONE-WORK.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE CORRESPONDING REC2 TO ZONE-WORK.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE CORRESPONDING REC3 TO ZONE-WORK.
