  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD  1  TO  NB-LUS.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF  FIRS  =  0  MOVE  1  TO  FIRS  GO TO CONT1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => LECT2.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD   LMONT1 OF ZONE-WORK TO  MONT1  OF  SUB-TOTAL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD   LMONT2 OF ZONE-WORK TO  MONT2  OF  SUB-TOTAL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD   LMONT3 OF ZONE-WORK TO  MONT3  OF  SUB-TOTAL.
