  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD   LMONT8 OF ZONE-WORK TO  MONT8  OF  SUB-TOTAL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD   LMONT9 OF ZONE-WORK TO  MONT9  OF  SUB-TOTAL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => CONT1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE  0  TO MONT1   OF SUB-TOTAL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE  0  TO MONT2   OF SUB-TOTAL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE  0  TO MONT3   OF SUB-TOTAL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE  0  TO MONT4   OF SUB-TOTAL.
